  "idea": "Raycast vs Alfred: which Mac productivity launcher takes the crown",
  "text": "Raycast versus Alfred: is it time to retire Alfred for the modern challenger? Alfred dominated Mac productivity for years, but managing complex AppleScripts and paid Powerpack licenses feels dated. Broken legacy workflows disrupt your flow whenever macOS updates alter system scripting permissions. Raycast provides a free React-based extension store, built-in window management, and native AI commands out of the box. You control your workspace in milliseconds without a mouse.",
